{"ts": 0.163115, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 1 of 3   The shell runs the programs you name. What kind of thing is the\r\n\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          shell itself?\r\n", "len": 124}
{"ts": 0.163223, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "a program\n", "len": 10}
{"ts": 0.163253, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "a program\r\n", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.166835, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          a program    a file    a folder    a window\r\n", "len": 67}
{"ts": 0.166901, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 29}
{"ts": 0.177379, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.181486, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 2 of 3   What do you type to ask whether zsh is installed?\r\n\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 87}
